        <tr>
            <td width=623 valign=top style='width:467.5pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt'>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:10.0pt;line-height:normal'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='color:black'>11.</span>
                    </b><b>
                        <span style='font-size:7.0pt;color:black'>
                            &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
                        </span><span style='color:black'> <u>SURRENDER OF PLOT</u></span>
                    </b>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;
  margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:1.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-31.5pt;
  line-height:normal'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='color:black'>
                            (i)<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>
                                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
                            </span>
                        </span>
                    </b><span style='color:black'>
                        The allottee/lessee can surrender
                        the Industrial Plot/Premises in favour of NOIDA before cancellation. The
                        NOIDA may permit the surrender of the plot, subject to necessary deductions,
                        as per the prevailing policy of the NOIDA at the time of surrender, from the
                        deposits made by the allottee/lessee to NOIDA.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;
  margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:1.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-31.5pt;
  line-height:normal'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='color:black'>
                            (ii)<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>
                                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
                            </span>
                        </span>
                    </b><span style='color:black'>
                        The request for surrender should
                        contain attested signatures of bonafide allottee/lessee. In case of
                        incorporated company, the request should be supported by the Certified Copy
                        of the Resolution of Board of Directors/Executives.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;
  margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:1.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-31.5pt;
  line-height:normal'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='font-size:12.0pt;color:black'>
                            (iii)<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>
                                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
                            </span>
                        </span>
                    </b><span style='color:black'>
                        The allottee shall have to
                        execute a surrender deed. All original legal documents shall also have to be
                        surrendered unconditionally to NOIDA, incase lease deed/transfer deed has
                        been executed.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;
  margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:1.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-31.5pt;
  line-height:normal'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='color:black'>
                            (iv)<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>
                                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
                            </span>
                        </span>
                    </b><span style='color:black'> </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;
  margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:2.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.25in;
  line-height:normal'>
                    a.<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>
                        &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
                    </span><span style='color:black'>
                        The entire deposit(s) made to the NOIDA,
                        after deducting Rs. 10,000/-, would be refunded by NOIDA, without any
                        interest in case the surrender made within 30 days from the date of
                        allotment.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraphCxSpLast style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;
  margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:2.0in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.25in;
  line-height:normal'>
                    b.<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>
                        &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
                    </span><span style='color:black'>
                        In case legal documentation has been
                        executed and possession of the plot has been taken over to the allottee then
                        the deposits made under revenue heads(s) (excluding interest against the
                        revenue) and 5% of the total cost of plot shall be forfeited along with the
                        due lease rent or Rs. 1,00,000/- which ever is higher.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:10.0pt;line-height:normal'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='color:black'>12.</span>
                    </b><b>
                        <span style='font-size:7.0pt;color:black'>
                            &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
                        </span><span style='color:black'>
                            <u>
                                EXECUTION OF LEASE
                                DEED
                            </u>
                        </span>
                    </b>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'>
                    <span style='color:black'>
                        The allottee will have to execute the lease deed within 3
                        months from the date of issue of allotment letter and take physical
                        possession of the plot within fifteen days from the date of execution of the
                        lease deed. In case of failure to execute the lease deed &amp; taking over of
                        physical possession within the above-stipulated period, the allotment may be
                        cancelled and amount would be forfeited as per rules as per the clause
                        11(iv). However, in exceptional circumstances the NOIDA may grant extension
                        of time for execution of lease deed &amp; taking over of possession. The
                        extension, if granted, will be subject to the payment of penalty charges as
                        per the policy of NOIDA.&nbsp;
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'>
                    <span style='color:black'>
                        The date of execution of lease deed will be treated as
                        the date of handing over of actual possession, notwithstanding any other
                        claim.
                    </span>
                </p>
            </td>
