        <tr>
            <td width=642 valign=top style='width:481.55pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt'>
                <p class=MsoListParagraph style='margin-bottom:10.0pt;text-indent:-.5in;
  line-height:normal'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='color:black'>
                            <span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>
                                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
                            </span>V.<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>
                                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
                            </span>
                        </span>
                    </b><span style='color:black'>
                        The allottee shall ensure to
                        implement their project within 3 years from the date of execution of
                        lease&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; deed and submit following documents for declaration
                        of unit as functional:-
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;text-align:justify;text-indent:
