                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td width=623 valign=top style='width:467.5pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt'>
                <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='color:black'>Allotment of Industrial Plot</span>
                    </b>
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td width=623 valign=top style='width:467.5pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt'>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
  margin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.25in'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='color:black;text-transform:uppercase'>1.</span>
                    </b><b>
                        <span style='font-size:7.0pt;line-height:106%;color:black;text-transform:uppercase'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='color:black;text-transform:uppercase'></span>
                    </b><span style='color:black'>
                        Application must be complete. Application forms submitted
                        with incomplete information(s)/ enclosure(s) may be rejected.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
  margin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.25in'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='color:black;text-transform:uppercase'>2.</span>
                    </b><b>
                        <span style='font-size:7.0pt;line-height:106%;color:black;text-transform:uppercase'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='color:black;text-transform:uppercase'></span>
                    </b><span style='color:black'>
                        The scheme is open for both General Applicants as well as
                        for industrialist who already have a plot in Noida Industrial Area. A total
                        of 33% of the plot shall be reserved for industrialists who wish to apply for
                        plot under expansion or setting up their own unit if working on rent
                        permission basis/shifting of unit running on rent permission. Certain plots
                        have also been reserved for start-up firms separately.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:.25in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.25in'>
