                <p class=MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst style='margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;
  text-indent:-.25in;line-height:normal'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='font-size:12.0pt;
  color:black'>
                            (x)<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>
                                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
                            </span>
                        </span>
                    </b><span style='color:black'>
                        The application along with the
                        requisite documents will be screened by a Screening Committee. The
                        application shall be scrutinized against the criteria as mentioned in the
                        table on page 4 &amp; 5 of the application form. The eligible applications
                        shall then be considered for manual draw and the incomplete
                        application/without requisite documents will not be recommended for public
                        draw. The date of draw shall be informed later through Public Notice.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style='margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;
  text-indent:-.25in;line-height:normal'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='font-size:12.0pt;
  color:black'>(xi)<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp; </span></span>
                    </b><b>
                        <i>
                            <u>
                                <span style='color:black'>For plots measuring greater than 4000 sq.mtrs</span>
                            </u>
                        </i>
                    </b><span style='color:black'>
                        , incase the number of applications for this category
                        exceeds the number of plots available, the applicants shall be invited for a
                        screening in person before the Screening Committee. The Screening Committee
                        shal l then recommend the applicants for land/plot allotment after examining
                        their applications.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraphCxSpLast style='margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;
  text-indent:-.25in;line-height:normal'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='color:black'>
                            (xii)<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'></span>
                        </span>
                    </b><span style='color:black'>
                        No correspondence shall be entertained from the
                        applicants, whose application(s) are rejected for any reasons or whose
                        candidature is not recommended by the screening committee or allotment
                        committe e . However, their registration money would be refunded, without any
                        interest, t o the account number mentioned in the application.
                    </span>
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
