  -.5in;line-height:normal'>
                    <span style='font-size:12.0pt'>
                        <span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>
                            &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
                        </span>I.<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>
                            &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
                        </span>
                    </span><span style='color:black'>
                        Allottee will commence the
                        construction within <b>6 </b>months from taking over the physical possession
                        of the plot&nbsp; as per duly approved building plan from concerned
                        department and shall inform in writing to NOIDA about timely completion of
                        the building as per approved plan and start of production/functioning.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style='text-align:justify;text-indent:
  -.5in;line-height:normal'>
