                    </span>II.<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>
                        &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
                    </span><span style='color:black'>
                        The allottee/lessee/transferee will adhere
                        to the following schedule of the construction of the building over the
                        allotted plot:-
                    </span>
                </p>
