<div align=center>

    <table class=MsoNormalTable border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width="111%"
           style='width:111.48%;border-collapse:collapse'>
        <tr>
            <td width=695 valign=top style='width:521.15pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt'>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;line-height:normal'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='color:black'>21.</span>
                    </b><b>
                        <span style='font-size:7.0pt;color:black'>
                            &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
                        </span><span style='color:black'>
                            <u>
                                CONSEQUENCES OF
                                MISREPRESENTATION
                            </u>
                        </span>
                    </b>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:10.0pt;
  margin-left:34.65pt;line-height:normal'>
                    <span style='color:black'>
                        If the
                        allotment is found to be obtained by any misrepresentation, concealment,
                        suppression of any material facts by the allottee/lessee, the allotment of
                        plot will be cancelled and/or lease will be determined, as the case may
                        be.&nbsp; In addition, the entire money deposited by the allottee/lessee
                        shall be forfeited and legal action for such misrepresentation, concealment
                        and suppression of material facts shall be taken.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:10.0pt;line-height:normal'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='color:black'>22.</span>
                    </b><b>
                        <span style='font-size:7.0pt;color:black'>
                            &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
                        </span><span style='color:black'>
                            <u>
                                CONSEQUENCES OF
                                BREACH OF TERMS &amp; CONDITIONS
                            </u>
                        </span>
                    </b>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst style='margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;
  text-indent:-1.0in;line-height:normal'>
                    <span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>
                        &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
                    </span>I.<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>
                        &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
                    </span><span style='color:black'>The</span><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
  color:black;text-transform:uppercase'>noida</span><span style='color:black'>
                        can exercise its right to cancellation of industrial plot an account of
                        breach of terms and conditions of allotment/lease deed/transfer deed.
                        However, the NOIDA can restore the allotment of the plot. In case of
                        restoration, allottee/lessee would pay restoration charges as per the
                        prevailing policy of the NOIDA &amp; have to follow other conditions of
                        restoration of the allotment.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraphCxSpLast style='margin-left:1.0in;text-align:justify;
  text-indent:-1.0in;line-height:normal'>
                    <span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>
                        &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
                    </span>II.<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>
                        &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
                    </span><span style='color:black'>
                        The lessee shall enjoy quiet possession of
                        the demised premises without disturbance by it or its successors in the
                        interest of any person claiming title paramount thereto.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:10.0pt;line-height:normal'>
                    <b>
                        <span style='color:black'>23.</span>
                    </b><b>
                        <span style='font-size:7.0pt;color:black'>
                            &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
                        </span><span style='color:black'>
                            <u>
                                AVAILABILITY OF PLOTS
                                FOR ALLOTMENT
                            </u>
                        </span>
                    </b>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:10.0pt;
  margin-left:34.65pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal'>
                    <span style='color:black'>
                        List of available plots for allotment shall be displayed
                        on the Notice Board of the NOIDA at its Administrative Office, Sector 6,
                        Noida and on the official website of NOIDA i.e.
                        www.noidaauthorityonline.com.&nbsp; Number of plots may increase or decrease
                        depending on the availability of the land.&nbsp; The NOIDA reserves the right
                        to withdraw any plot from and/or add any plot to the allotment process at any
                        time, without assigning any reasons.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:10.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:
  normal'>
                    <b><span style='color:black'>24.</span></b><b>
                        <span style='font-size:
  7.0pt;color:black'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='color:black'>
                            <u>
                                RENTING
                                PERMISSION
                            </u>
                        </span>
                    </b>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:10.0pt;
  margin-left:34.65pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal'>
                    <span style='color:black'>
                        No renting permission shall be given by <span style='text-transform:uppercase'>noida</span> in the allotted premises before
                        the unit has formally been declared functional by <span style='text-transform:
  uppercase'>noida</span>. <span style='text-transform:uppercase'>noida</span>
                        may consider such application as per prevailing policy of the <span style='text-transform:uppercase'>noida</span> on the date of receipt of such
                        application on the payment of charges accrued. These charges shall be
                        exclusive of GST. The accrued GST charges shall have to borne by the
                        allottee.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:10.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:
  normal'>
                    <b><span style='color:black'>25.</span></b><b>
                        <span style='font-size:
  7.0pt;color:black'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='color:black'>
                            <u>
                                PERIOD
                                OF LEASE
                            </u>
                        </span>
                    </b>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:10.0pt;
  margin-left:34.65pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal'>
                    <span style='color:black'>
                        The allotment of plot will be made on leasehold basis for
                        a period of 90 years from the date of execution of lease deed.
                    </span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:10.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:
  normal'>
                    <b><span style='color:black'>26.</span></b><b>
                        <span style='font-size:
  7.0pt;color:black'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='color:black'>
                            <u>
                                <span style='text-transform:uppercase'>Violation of terms and conditions</span>
                            </u>
                        </span>
                    </b>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:10.0pt;
  margin-left:34.65pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal'>
                    <span style='color:black'>
                        Any violation of terms(s) and condition(s) of allotment/
                        Lease Deed/ Transfer deed shall invite cancellation/ revocation of allotment
                        / Lease Deed/ Transfer deed to be preceded by dispossession of Industrial
                        Premises. The amount deposited would be forfeited / refunded as per rules
                        prevailing at that time. At present 5% (Five percent) of the premium of the
                        plot is forfeited along with deposits made under the revenue heads(s)
                        (excluding the interest deposited against premium) and the due lease rent
                        till the date of dispossession of Industrial premises. However, the total
                        forfeited amount would not exceed the total deposited amount
                    </span>
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td width=695 valign=top style='width:521.15pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt'>
                <p class=MsoNormal align=right style='margin-bottom:10.0pt;text-align:right;
  line-height:normal'><span style='color:black'>&nbsp;</span></p>
                <p class=MsoNormal align=right style='margin-bottom:10.0pt;text-align:right;
  line-height:normal'><span style='color:black'>&nbsp;</span></p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:10.0pt;line-height:normal'>
                    <span style='color:black'>&nbsp;</span>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal align=right style='text-align:right;line-height:normal'>
                    <img id="signature" src="@Model.SignImage" alt="your sign" height="40px" width="140px" name="usersign" /><br />
                    <span style='color:black'>Signatures of the Authorised Signatory</span>
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

</div>
