                    </b>
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td width=695 valign=top style='width:521.15pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt'>
                <p class=MsoBodyText2 style='line-height:150%'>
                    <b>
                        <i>
                            <span style='color:black'>
                                The
                                following is the list of industry which may be permitted in industrial area
                                developed by New Okhla Industrial Development Authority
                            </span>
                        </i>
                    </b>
